[SIZE=6][B]👻 Halloween Plugin v1.7.0 - Herobrine Event[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]What's New:[/B][/SIZE]

[B]🕯️ Herobrine Progressive Scare Event[/B]
Experience the legend! Herobrine now haunts players at night with a terrifying 4-stage encounter system.

[SIZE=5][B]How It Works:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Stage 1:[/B] Herobrine appears far away (3 chunks), watching you...
[*][B]Stage 2:[/B] He moves closer (2 chunks), still watching...
[*][B]Stage 3:[/B] Now very close (1 chunk), getting ready...
[*][B]Stage 4:[/B] Invisible attack from behind with creepy effects!
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Herobrine Features:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]✅ Only spawns at night (13000-23000 ticks)
[*]✅ Progressive stages with 10-20 second delays
[*]✅ Auto-despawns after 20 seconds per stage
[*]✅ Despawns if you approach too close (stages 1-3)
[*]✅ Smart spawn validation (no water, no underground, no Nether/End)
[*]✅ Custom Steve skin with white eyes
[*]✅ Particles and horror sounds
[*]✅ Final stage: invisible attack with 3-second buildup
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Configuration:[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
intervals:
  herobrine:
    min: 40  # Minutes (default)
    max: 80

herobrine:
  enabled: true
  render_distance: 3
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B]Admin Commands:[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]
/halloween set herobrine <min> <max>  # Adjust spawn interval
/halloween cleanup                    # Remove leftover Herobrines
[/CODE]

[SIZE=5][B]Bug Fixes:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]🔧 Fixed leftover Herobrine entities after crashes
[*]🔧 Fixed texture loading across different server types
[*]🔧 Fixed sequences getting stuck when day arrives
[*]🔧 Auto-cleanup on plugin startup
[*]🔧 Players with Halloween disabled never see Herobrine
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Messages:[/B][/SIZE]
20+ unique Herobrine messages for each stage, including:
[LIST]
[*][I]"You feel like someone is watching you..."[/I]
[*][I]"The air grows cold as a shadow moves in the distance..."[/I]
[*][I]"You hear footsteps behind you..."[/I]
[*][I]"Something strikes you from the darkness!"[/I]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][I]Compatible with Minecraft 1.20+ | Spigot/Paper/Purpur | Requires [FONT=Courier New]halloween.admin[/FONT] permission for commands[/I][/SIZE]

[B]Note:[/B] Existing configs auto-update! Pre-1.7.0 users will have Herobrine section added automatically.
